GeneralsX: a video clip that ends while the swap chain presents is
finished on its own thread. Finishing writes out the queued frames,
closes the output and waits for the encoder to exit, which stalled the
present of the last clip frame for about half a second. The clip is
reported as stopped (DXVK_CAPTURE_VIDEO_STATE) once it is complete, and
the swap chain blitter waits for unfinished clips when it goes away.

